<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="Digital Billboard Placement on the DreamLedger public billboard.">
<title>Digital Billboard Placement | DreamLedger</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;background:#070707;color:#f4f2eb;font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
main{max-width:980px;margin:auto;padding:48px 20px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;gap:28px;align-items:center}
.card{background:#111;border:1px solid #292929;border-radius:20px;padding:24px}
h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem);line-height:.85;letter-spacing:-.08em;margin:10px 0 22px}
.gold{color:#f2c14e}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#f2c14e;color:#080808;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:900;text-decoration:none;margin:6px 6px 6px 0}
.alt{background:#171717;color:#fff;border:1px solid #333}
.qr{width:245px;height:245px;background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:16px}
.muted{color:#89857d}
.price{font-size:2rem;font-weight:1000;color:#f2c14e}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<div class="grid">
<section>
<div class="muted">DREAMLEDGER / DIGITAL REAL ESTATE</div>
<h1>Digital <span class="gold">Billboard</span> Placement.</h1>
<p>One placement on the DreamLedger public billboard. Includes a QR code distribution asset and a direct destination path.</p>
<div class="card">
<div class="muted">Existing verified billboard offer</div>
<div class="price">NZ$149</div>
<p class="muted">The account already has a similar live billboard product, so no duplicate Stripe product was created.</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://buy.stripe.com/28EfZh4zr29v5Ub18odwc1v">Buy Now</a>
<a class="btn alt" href="/billboard.html">View full billboard</a>
</div>
</section>
<aside class="card">
<img class="qr" src="/qr/billboard.png" alt="QR code for DreamLedger billboard">
<p class="muted">Scan to open this billboard surface.</p>
</aside>
</div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
